WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:03.167
-Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show," everyone.

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:04.167
You're here, you all made it.

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:05.300
Thank you for watching.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.901 --> 00:00:10.067
Well guys, if you watch MSNBC,
I want to say,

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:12.033
happy Indigenous Peoples' Day.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:15.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:18.067
If you watch Fox News, I want
to say happy Columbus Day.

00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:20.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:22.133
That's right, 530 years ago,

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:23.934
Columbus went on a trip,
but never made it

00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:25.534
to his intended destination.

00:00:25.534 --> 00:00:28.000
Today, we call that flying
Southwest Airlines.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.934 --> 00:00:32.434
Meanwhile, today is also
Canadian Thanksgiving.

00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:34.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.701
So, happy Thanksgiving.

00:00:36.701 --> 00:00:38.267
It's just like American
Thanksgiving,

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:39.534
except everyone
goes around the table

00:00:39.534 --> 00:00:41.033
saying what they're sorry for.

00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:42.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:43.834
Sorry.

00:00:43.834 --> 00:00:45.501
Americans can never have
Thanksgiving on a Monday.

00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:47.300
We need at least three days
to digest that meal.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.434
Right?

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:49.701
Let's get to some news.

00:00:49.701 --> 00:00:51.868
Over the weekend, former
President Trump held a rally

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:54.200
in Nevada and he tried
to downplay

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.767
his classified documents scandal

00:00:55.767 --> 00:00:57.634
by bringing up
some former presidents.

00:00:57.634 --> 00:00:58.901
Check this out.

00:00:58.901 --> 00:01:02.801
-Barack Hussein Obama moved
more than 20 truckloads,

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:06.000
over 33 million pages
of documents,

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.701
both classified
and unclassified,

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:11.367
to a poorly-built and
totally unsafe

00:01:11.367 --> 00:01:13.133
former furniture store.

00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:16.534
Bill Clinton took millions of
documents from the White House

00:01:16.534 --> 00:01:19.100
to a former car dealership
in Arkansas

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:23.033
and kept classified recordings
in his sock drawer.

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:25.400
So, we call it the Sock Case.

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:29.200
George H.W. Bush took
millions of documents

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:32.300
to a former bowling alley
and a former Chinese restaurant,

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:33.467
where they combined them.

00:01:33.467 --> 00:01:36.968
So, they're in a bowling
alley/Chinese restaurant.

00:01:36.968 --> 00:01:39.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:41.234
-That's what the Trump robot
at Disney sounds like

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.033
when someone spills coffee
on the circuit board.

00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:45.100
It's like, [As Trump]
"It's a bowling alley,

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.033
but it's not
a Chinese restaurant."

00:01:47.033 --> 00:01:48.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.701 --> 00:01:50.968
Get this -- according to
a new poll, if the GOP

00:01:50.968 --> 00:01:52.934
doesn't win control of Congress
in the midterms,

00:01:52.934 --> 00:01:56.767
nearly 40% of Republicans
will blame election fraud.

00:01:56.767 --> 00:01:59.067
Yeah, and when they heard
the results, 40% of Republicans

00:01:59.067 --> 00:02:00.634
were like,
"That poll was rigged."

00:02:00.634 --> 00:02:02.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.467
Some entertainment news.

00:02:03.467 --> 00:02:06.167
"Smile" came in first at the box
office again this past weekend.

00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:08.901
And "Lyle, Lyle, Crocodile"
came in second.

00:02:08.901 --> 00:02:11.200
Well, apparently the makers
of "Lyle, Lyle, Crocodile"

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:13.267
are trying to pivot to make it
more like "Smile,"

00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:14.334
but I'm not sure it works.

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:15.868
Check out the new trailer
I just saw today.

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.734
♪♪

00:02:17.734 --> 00:02:21.133
-I'm seeing something no one
else can see except for me.

00:02:21.133 --> 00:02:23.200
It's smiling at me.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:24.367
No!

00:02:24.367 --> 00:02:25.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.801 --> 00:02:28.801
[ Dramatic music plays ]

00:02:28.801 --> 00:02:30.501
The worst smile I've ever seen.

00:02:30.501 --> 00:02:31.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.634 --> 00:02:33.968
[ Screaming ]

00:02:33.968 --> 00:02:36.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.934
-Okay. Interesting, right?
-Wow.

00:02:37.934 --> 00:02:40.434
"Smyle, Smyle, Crocodile."

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:45.000
Well, switching gears, the
U.S. Postal service announced

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.200
that it wants to raise stamp
prices from 60 to 63 cents.

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.267
And based on the number of
people who still write letters,

00:02:52.267 --> 00:02:54.334
that could create up to $10
in new revenue.

00:02:54.334 --> 00:02:57.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.634 --> 00:02:59.234
And finally, it is the beginning
of the week,

00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:00.534
and I thought it'd be
nice to kick things off

00:03:00.534 --> 00:03:01.968
with a few words
of encouragement.

00:03:01.968 --> 00:03:03.968
It's time for some
"Monday Motivations."

00:03:03.968 --> 00:03:04.968
♪♪

00:03:04.968 --> 00:03:09.300
-♪ Monday Motivations ♪

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:12.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:12.067 --> 00:03:15.067
When Timothee Chalamet
has to cry on camera,

00:03:15.067 --> 00:03:17.367
he thinks about
how he's never met you.

00:03:17.367 --> 00:03:20.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:20.834 --> 00:03:24.300
That gray hair just fell onto
your head from someone else.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:27.801
[ Applause ]

00:03:27.801 --> 00:03:30.601
You could run a marathon,
but you're so selfless,

00:03:30.601 --> 00:03:33.400
you prefer to just cheer
other people on from home.

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:37.100
[ Applause ]

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:39.467
Everyone finishes their popcorn
before the movie starts.

00:03:39.467 --> 00:03:40.901
It's what you're supposed to do.

00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:44.767
[ Applause ]

00:03:44.767 --> 00:03:47.701
You're the hot sibling,
the smart sibling,

00:03:47.701 --> 00:03:49.334
and the funny sibling.

00:03:49.334 --> 00:03:51.400
And that's not just because
you're the only sibling.

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:54.334
[ Applause ]

00:03:55.901 --> 00:03:58.567
It's actually your phone
who's addicted to you.

00:03:58.567 --> 00:04:02.200
[ Applause ]

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:05.100
And finally, you've used so many
paper straws that now,

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:08.634
in turtle language,
"Jessica" means God.

00:04:08.634 --> 00:04:09.634
We have a great show...

